00:35:31.180 --> 00:35:53.770
<v Caroline Kitchener>Lilly's dad is former Air Force. Now he works in IT. He loves music Lilly likes to describe as dad rock-- AC/DC, Bon Jovi. He has five kids, three boys and two girls. He grew up in a conservative family, believing it was wrong to have an abortion. Lilly didn't know what he would think about her wanting an abortion.
<v Caroline Kitchener>莉莉的父亲贾斯汀（Justin）是空军退役人员。现在从事IT工作。他喜欢那种莉莉称之为“老爸摇滚”的音乐——AC/DC、邦·乔维（Bon Jovi）。他有五个孩子，三个男孩，两个女孩。他在一个保守的家庭长大，认为堕胎是错误的。莉莉不知道他会怎么看她想要堕胎的想法。

