00:36:51.610 --> 00:37:04.990
<v Caroline Kitchener>Was he actually disappointed? Did he actually not want her to get the abortion? What was he thinking when the doctor told them she was pregnant? When they drove home that night, Lilly hadn't asked him. So I did.
