<v Justin>Well, because-- so the guy, he'd already gotten another 15, 16-year-old girl pregnant and had a baby with her. So yeah. The next thing in my mind is I'm calling the three brothers, and this is getting handled. That was the immediate, you've ruined your life. You're 17 years old. You're going to have a baby now.
<v Justin>嗯，因为——那个男孩，他已经让另一个15、16岁的女孩怀孕并有了孩子。所以，是的。我脑子里的下一个想法是，我要打电话给那三个哥哥，这件事得处理掉。那种即刻的反应是：你毁了你自己。你才17岁。你现在要有个孩子了。

